WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.220
Two brands tied for mentions.

00:00:02.420 --> 00:00:04.800
But they didn’t tie for first choice.

00:00:05.060 --> 00:00:08.900
In Recoscope’s November tenth
standing desks benchmark,

00:00:09.380 --> 00:00:11.980
UPLIFT and FlexiSpot
each appeared in

00:00:11.980 --> 00:00:14.280
ten of eleven usable answers.

00:00:14.680 --> 00:00:16.240
In the comparison prompt,

00:00:16.520 --> 00:00:19.400
ChatGPT, Claude, and Perplexity

00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:22.960
all ranked UPLIFT first
and FlexiSpot second.

00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:25.160
Gemini’s incomplete comparison

00:00:25.160 --> 00:00:27.260
was excluded from the analysis.

00:00:27.260 --> 00:00:28.940
For brand owners,

00:00:29.140 --> 00:00:32.180
track how often you appear,
where you rank,

00:00:32.240 --> 00:00:34.280
and the context of the answer.

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:37.780
These findings describe
captured AI answers,

00:00:37.960 --> 00:00:39.440
not product quality.

00:00:39.660 --> 00:00:43.100
Explore benchmark at
getrecoscope.com.
